    "text": "BY virtue of powers vested in me under sections 154 F (1) and (5) of the 13th Amendment to the constitution of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka, I, Hemakumara Wickramathilake Nanayakkara, the Governor of the Southern Province, dohereby announce that I have made the following appointment for the seventh provincial council.",
